      "verbatim_texts": [
        "To begin the process, start by claiming what is requested and then check the insured status of the claimant."
      ],
      "justification": "Captures process initiation and the first sequence of steps (start, claim, check status) described in the opening unit."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b1->n8"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If the claimant is insured, proceed to evaluate the claim.",
        "However, if the claimant is not insured, reject the claim."
      ],
      "justification": "Correctly models the XOR decision split. Guards use variable abstractions ('Yes'/'No') that faithfully preserve the insured/not-insured branching logic and target actions."
    },
